    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIGHT-QUEST is a fast-paced, first-person melee game that combines the brutal, high-speed combat of FPS titles like ULTRAKILL with the addictive progression and endless hordes of roguelikes like Vampire Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hired hero working for a mysterious wizard, you\u2019ll battle through waves of fantasy enemies, earning gold to upgrade your abilities and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.poster.avif?t=1749661352\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.webm?t=1749661352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulslike melee combat with the fast-paced, first-person brutality of the FPS genre.  <br>Fight your way through hordes of old-school fantasy enemies, refreshed and brought to life with modern game design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.poster.avif?t=1749661352\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.webm?t=1749661352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unlikely companion is here to help! Choose from a selection of fairy enchantments to enhance your abilities. Discover hundreds of combinations of unique character builds as you battle the onslaught of enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.poster.avif?t=1749661352\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.webm?t=1749661352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to the stronghold known as Coin Keep with your collected gold. Should you have the capital, shopkeepers will unlock new arenas, weaponry, and consumable items.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIGHT-QUEST is a fast-paced, first-person melee game that combines the brutal, high-speed combat of FPS titles like ULTRAKILL with the addictive progression and endless hordes of roguelikes like Vampire Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hired hero working for a mysterious wizard, you\u2019ll battle through waves of fantasy enemies, earning gold to upgrade your abilities and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.poster.avif?t=1749661352\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.webm?t=1749661352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulslike melee combat with the fast-paced, first-person brutality of the FPS genre.  <br>Fight your way through hordes of old-school fantasy enemies, refreshed and brought to life with modern game design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.poster.avif?t=1749661352\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.webm?t=1749661352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unlikely companion is here to help! Choose from a selection of fairy enchantments to enhance your abilities. Discover hundreds of combinations of unique character builds as you battle the onslaught of enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.poster.avif?t=1749661352\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.webm?t=1749661352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to the stronghold known as Coin Keep with your collected gold. Should you have the capital, shopkeepers will unlock new arenas, weaponry, and consumable items.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Slay thousands of fantasy foes, choose game-changing abilities, and attempt to escape with your collected loot! FIGHT-QUEST is a fast-paced action roguelite where you're employed as a \u201chero\u201d at the command of a mysterious wizard.",
